  "scientific_scope": "Complete deterministic long-format TSV projections of all datasets in the four frozen HDF5 scientific files, covering experimental and theoretical energy-angle observations, dipole-matrix elements, angular coefficients, and phase/delay curves.",
  "analysis_unit": "One measured dipole-matrix energy block or one complete theory calculation block. The dense experiment-like phase/delay grid is a spline-derived representation of 13 measured energy blocks, so its cells are correlated derived values rather than independent observations.",
